<p>I want as many people as possible to be able to use this website, whatever their abilities and whatever technology they use. This statement applies to {{ site_url }}. It was prepared on {{ date }}.</p>
<h2>How accessible this website is</h2>
<p>This website aims to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at level AA. You should be able to:</p>
<ul>
<li>use the whole website with a keyboard only;</li>
<li>use it with a screen reader or speech recognition software;</li>
<li>zoom in up to 400% without text spilling off the screen;</li>
<li>change colours, contrast levels and fonts in your browser, and use dark mode;</li>
<li>read alternative text for pictures, and captions or transcripts for video and audio.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Feedback and contact</h2>
<p>If you find a problem, or you need information in a different format, <a href="{{ links.contact }}">contact me</a>. Tell me the address of the page and what went wrong, and I will reply as soon as I can.</p>
<h2>Technical information</h2>
<p>This website is built with SightPress, a content management system designed with blind and low-vision creators and audiences in mind. Every page is checked for common accessibility problems before it is published.</p>
